@DWis 1. 11. 1. The end is the very essence (in the cause and the effect).

@9Q 2. The essence purely Divine, which was the purely Divine celestial and Divine spiritual essence, transcends both the angelic and the human Rational.

@9Q 2[4]. "The Word"... was the Divine wisdom, which with the Divine love constitutes the Divine essence, and thus one and the same God.

