@CanonsNC 5. God 2. 2. And therefore this only God is Essence, Substance, and Form; and men and Angels are spiritual essences, substances, and forms; that is, images and likenesses...

@CanonsNC 5. God 2. 6. Consequently, another God, of the same essence with the one God, is not possible.

@CanonsNC 5. God 2. 7. The plurality of gods in ancient times, and partly so in modern ones, has had no other origin than from the non-understanding of the Divine essence.

